    "attributes": {
        "action": "Reform deportation Law for serious violent and sexual offenders",
        "additional_details": "The law should ensure that public safety and victims\u2019 rights are given proper weight in cases involving grave criminal offending.",
        "background": "We call on the Government to amend immigration and deportation law so that long-term residence protections cannot prevent deportation where a non-British citizen has been convicted of serious offences including child sexual exploitation, rape, trafficking, murder, or serious violence.",
